<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <choices>
        <name>ActionDesignate</name>
        <choiceText>Ejecutar designación (Demo/Exhibición)</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>DESIGNATE</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <choices>
        <name>ActionExecuteRelease</name>
        <choiceText>Ejecutar liberación para venta</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>RELEASE</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <choices>
        <name>StatusDealer</name>
        <choiceText>En ubicación de concesionario</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>En ubicación de concesionario</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <choices>
        <name>StatusDemoSale</name>
        <choiceText>Demo venta (la unidad fue demo; sigue siendo Nuevo)</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>Demo venta</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <choices>
        <name>TypeDemoExec</name>
        <choiceText>Demo</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>Demo</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <choices>
        <name>TypeExhibitionExec</name>
        <choiceText>Exhibición</choiceText>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <value><stringValue>Exhibicion</stringValue></value>
    </choices>
    <decisions>
        <name>WhichExecution</name>
        <label>Decision: Designation or Release?</label>
        <locationX>300</locationX><locationY>300</locationY>
        <defaultConnector><targetReference>SetVehicleReleased</targetReference></defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Release</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>ExecDesignation</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>SelectedAction</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>DESIGNATE</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>SetVehicleDesignated</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Designation</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>IsUnitFoundExec</name>
        <label>Decision: Unit Found?</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>200</locationY>
        <defaultConnector><targetReference>UnitNotFoundExecScreen</targetReference></defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not found</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>UnitFoundExec</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetVehicleExec</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>WhichExecution</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Floor manager execution screen (HU-046, Esc.1/7/12/14). All countries. Reads the user's pending "[Demo] Solicitud..." Tasks and executes: designation (Vehicle.Status = En demostración / En exhibicion) or release (Vehicle.Status = En ubicación de concesionario or Demo venta per decision D4; ConditionType REMAINS Nuevo; opens the VIN Opportunity with record type GQOpportunitiesAutos and Vehiculo__c = the released unit, which wires it to the Opportunity Before Handler guard). Closes the request Task. DESIGN NOTE 05/08: SerializedProduct.Status is a system-restricted picklist (custom values NOT allowed), so designation/release do NOT touch SerializedProduct.Status - the state machine lives on Vehicle.Status (see Opportunity Before Handler). Release updates Vehicle.Status BEFORE creating the Opportunity, so the guard does not block it. TODO-DAVI: (1) physical transfer stays in the CBSF Vehicle Transfer action (T02); (2) initial Opportunity StageName per GRPQM sales process (assumed Prospecting); (3) picklist API values verbatim from the org: En exhibicion has NO accent.</description>
    <dynamicChoiceSets>
        <name>PendingRequests</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <displayField>Subject</displayField>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$User.Id</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Status</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value><stringValue>Completed</stringValue></value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <operator>StartsWith</operator>
            <value><stringValue>[Demo] Solicitud</stringValue></value>
        </filters>
        <object>Task</object>
        <valueField>Id</valueField>
    </dynamicChoiceSets>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>designationStatus</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!SelectedType} = 'Demo', 'En demostración', 'En exhibicion')</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>opportunityCloseDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY() + 30</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>opportunityName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>'Venta unidad demo ' &amp; {!UnitSerial}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Execute Demo Request {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Screen Flow: Execute Demo Request</label>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateVinOpportunity</name>
        <label>Create Records: Create VIN Opportunity</label>
        <locationX>500</locationX><locationY>600</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>CloseRequestTaskRelease</targetReference></connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>CloseDate</field>
            <value><elementReference>opportunityCloseDate</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Name</field>
            <value><elementReference>opportunityName</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>RecordTypeId</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetOpportunityRecordType.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>StageName</field>
            <value><stringValue>Prospecting</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Vehiculo__c</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetVehicleExec.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetOpportunityRecordType</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Opportunity Record Type</label>
        <locationX>500</locationX><locationY>550</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>CreateVinOpportunity</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>DeveloperName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><stringValue>GQOpportunitiesAutos</stringValue></value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>SobjectType</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><stringValue>Opportunity</stringValue></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>RecordType</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetVehicleExec</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Vehicle</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>100</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>IsUnitFoundExec</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Name</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>UnitSerial</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Vehicle</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>CloseRequestTaskDesignation</name>
        <label>Update Records: Close Request Task</label>
        <locationX>100</locationX><locationY>500</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>LogExecutionDesignation</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>SelectedRequest</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status</field>
            <value><stringValue>Completed</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>CloseRequestTaskRelease</name>
        <label>Update Records: Close Request Task (Release)</label>
        <locationX>500</locationX><locationY>700</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>LogExecutionRelease</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>SelectedRequest</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status</field>
            <value><stringValue>Completed</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>SetVehicleDesignated</name>
        <label>Update Records: Set Vehicle to Designated Status</label>
        <locationX>100</locationX><locationY>400</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>CloseRequestTaskDesignation</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>GetVehicleExec.Id</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status</field>
            <value><elementReference>designationStatus</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Vehicle</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>SetVehicleReleased</name>
        <label>Update Records: Set Vehicle to Released Status</label>
        <locationX>500</locationX><locationY>400</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>GetOpportunityRecordType</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>GetVehicleExec.Id</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status</field>
            <value><elementReference>ReleaseStatus</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Vehicle</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <screens>
        <name>DoneScreen</name>
        <label>Screen: Show Execution Result</label>
        <locationX>300</locationX><locationY>800</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>DoneText</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Ejecución completada. La Task quedó cerrada con ejecutor y fecha/hora. Si la unidad requiere traslado físico, use la acción Vehicle Transfer de la búsqueda de inventario (T02).&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>SelectionScreen</name>
        <label>Screen: Select Request and Action</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>50</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <connector><targetReference>GetVehicleExec</targetReference></connector>
        <fields>
            <name>SelectedRequest</name>
            <choiceReferences>PendingRequests</choiceReferences>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
            <fieldText>Solicitud pendiente a ejecutar (sus Tasks [Demo])</fieldText>
            <fieldType>RadioButtons</fieldType>
            <isRequired>true</isRequired>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>SelectedAction</name>
            <choiceReferences>ActionDesignate</choiceReferences>
            <choiceReferences>ActionExecuteRelease</choiceReferences>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
            <fieldText>Acción a ejecutar</fieldText>
            <fieldType>RadioButtons</fieldType>
            <isRequired>true</isRequired>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>UnitSerial</name>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
            <fieldText>VIN / Número de serie de la unidad</fieldText>
            <fieldType>InputField</fieldType>
            <isRequired>true</isRequired>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>SelectedType</name>
            <choiceReferences>TypeDemoExec</choiceReferences>
            <choiceReferences>TypeExhibitionExec</choiceReferences>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
            <fieldText>Si es designación: tipo</fieldText>
            <fieldType>RadioButtons</fieldType>
            <isRequired>false</isRequired>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>ReleaseStatus</name>
            <choiceReferences>StatusDealer</choiceReferences>
            <choiceReferences>StatusDemoSale</choiceReferences>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
            <fieldText>Si es liberación: estado destino del Vehicle (decisión D4)</fieldText>
            <fieldType>RadioButtons</fieldType>
            <isRequired>false</isRequired>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>UnitNotFoundExecScreen</name>
        <label>Screen: Show Unit Not Found</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX><locationY>300</locationY>
        <allowBack>true</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>UnitNotFoundExecText</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;No se encontró la unidad con el VIN/serial informado. Vuelva atrás y verifique.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <start>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>SelectionScreen</targetReference></connector>
    </start>
    <status>Draft</status>
    <subflows>
        <name>LogExecutionDesignation</name>
        <label>Subflow: Log Demo Activity (Designation)</label>
        <locationX>100</locationX><locationY>600</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>DoneScreen</targetReference></connector>
        <flowName>LogDemoActivity</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>actionType</name>
            <value><stringValue>Designación ejecutada</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>activityDetails</name>
            <value><stringValue>Designación Demo/Exhibición ejecutada por el encargado de piso. Traslado físico, si aplica, vía Vehicle Transfer (T02).</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>taskOwnerId</name>
            <value><elementReference>$User.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>taskStatus</name>
            <value><stringValue>Completed</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>vehicleId</name>
            <value><elementReference>GetVehicleExec.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
    <subflows>
        <name>LogExecutionRelease</name>
        <label>Subflow: Log Demo Activity (Release)</label>
        <locationX>500</locationX><locationY>750</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>DoneScreen</targetReference></connector>
        <flowName>LogDemoActivity</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>actionType</name>
            <value><stringValue>Liberación ejecutada</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>activityDetails</name>
            <value><stringValue>Liberación para venta ejecutada. ConditionType se mantiene Nuevo; Opportunity del VIN creada (RT GQOpportunitiesAutos).</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>taskOwnerId</name>
            <value><elementReference>$User.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>taskStatus</name>
            <value><stringValue>Completed</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>vehicleId</name>
            <value><elementReference>GetVehicleExec.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
</Flow>
